OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does Wythenshawe mean to
OL,4,Athose who know it best?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year marks 100 years since
OL,7,FWythenshawe Hall was donated to
OL,8,FManchester Corporation.
OL,10,FAt the time, the city was in urgent
OL,11,Fneed of more housing.
OL,13,FIn 1920 an urban planner called Patrick
OL,14,FAbercrombie identified Wythenshawe as
OL,15,Fthe only undeveloped land suitable for
OL,16,Fbuilding a housing estate close to
OL,17,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
