OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does Wythenshawe mean to
OL,4,Athose who know it best?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo turn his proposal into a reality,
OL,7,FErnest and Shena Simon bought
OL,8,FWythenshawe Hall from Robert Henry
OL,9,FGrenville Tatton in 1926, which they
OL,10,Fdonated to the city's corporation (now
OL,11,Fknown as the council).
